## Recently built n8n workflows (already integrated)
- `BCC Inquiry Alert` (`U1gvYq4WnZvxyMIm`) → `/webhook/bcc-inquiry-alert` (created + status changed + closed; closed includes staff `handledBy` / `closedBy`). New Get Involved messages also send a visitor greeting Gmail (like subscribe welcome); staff Telegram/Gmail and Admin follow-up are unchanged.
- `BCC Publish Distribution` (`czx6JcuNWP2unBRv`) → `/webhook/bcc-publish-distribution`
- `BCC Subscribe Alert` (`JBDK9TqPnYJCkAMn`) → `/webhook/bcc-subscribe-alert` (new/reactivated subscribers → Telegram/Gmail staff alert **and** professional welcome Gmail to the visitor with website, Events, About, Facebook group, and `info@bccwac.com`)
- `BCC Event Mail` (`bS9NmXubTc9y9Kc0`) → `/webhook/bcc-event-mail` (published upcoming event → Gmail to active subscribers + staff Telegram summary)
- Staff Telegram alerts use HTML parse mode with a shared layout: `BCC · …` headline, bold name, escaped user text (safer than Markdown for names/emails).
- Website env in `.dev.vars`: `CRM_ALERTS_ENABLED`, `N8N_INQUIRY_ALERT_WEBHOOK`, `N8N_PUBLISH_WEBHOOK`, `N8N_SUBSCRIBE_ALERT_WEBHOOK`, `N8N_EVENT_MAIL_WEBHOOK`, shared `N8N_INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_SECRET` (never commit).

## Tier 1 scheduled n8n workflows (added Aug 2026)
- `BCC Enquiry Follow-up Reminder` (`FWwHaDlFEScrwHcN`) — daily at 09:00 Perth (01:00 UTC); calls `/api/n8n/stats`; if any open inquiry is 3+ days old → Telegram nudge to staff chat.
- `BCC Monthly Summary Report` (`irGFDMqBM4Eyct0c`) — 1st of each month at 00:00 UTC; emails `bccwacharity@gmail.com` with open/stale enquiries, active subscribers, closed-this-month, and last event date.
- `BCC Subscriber Re-engagement Nudge` (`iR9ee5NYsKWHlHR6`) — every Monday 01:00 UTC; if active subscribers > 0 AND no event published in 30+ days → Telegram nudge to publish an event.
- All three call `GET https://bccwac.com/api/n8n/stats` with `x-n8n-secret: N8N_INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_SECRET` (n8n env var). Secret must be set on the n8n server environment.

## Mail subscribe → Admin → n8n → event emails
- Public form on Home + Events (`MailSubscribe`) posts to `/api/subscribers` with consent.
- Admin panel **Subscribers** list (owner/admin only); can mark unsubscribed.
- New subscribe alerts staff via `N8N_SUBSCRIBE_ALERT_WEBHOOK`, and n8n also sends a welcome email to the subscriber (not only staff).
- Publishing an **upcoming** event calls `N8N_EVENT_MAIL_WEBHOOK` with event details + active subscriber emails for Gmail delivery in n8n.
- Draft events never trigger mail. Re-saving an already-published event does not re-send.

## Enquiry close alerts + customer report
- Inquiry PATCH status changes call the same inquiry webhook (`community.inquiry.closed` / `community.inquiry.status_changed`) with signed-in staff `displayName` as `handledBy`.
- Closing sets `closed_by` / `closed_at` on `public_inquiries`; reopening clears them.
- Admin **Reports** (owner/admin): `/api/reports/customers` combines enquiries + subscribers with filters; Excel export (`.xlsx`) uses separate sheets **Enquiries** and **Subscribers**; optional PDF export keeps the same two sections on separate pages.

